      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "Three tools for the field. The Radar Gun aims 200 blocks and stores that spot as a target; right-click a Launch Control to copy it in. The Remote Detonator links to a placed warhead when you sneak-click it, and a right-click lights its fuse from 128 blocks (HV), 256 (EV) or 512 (IV).\n\nThe Defuse Kit puts a lit fuse out (right-click), or takes apart a missile standing on a pad or in a silo (left-click) before its countdown starts; it lasts 32 uses. Check NEI for the recipes. Make all three.\n\n[warn]A lit fuse doesn\u0027t wait for you. Defuse fast or run.[/warn]",
